{
  "name": "dsh-mcp-manager-panel",
  "version": "0.4.0",
  "description": "DSH MCP 服务管理面板（自足版）：设置页粘贴 mcpServers JSON 一键导入，厂商分组卡片视图，组级/单条档位管理，并自带 MCP 连接/工具注册/调用（stdio + streamable-http），无需能力库插件。v0.4.0：客户端 UI 对齐 DSH 设置面板——复用平台 ui-primitives 原子件（Button/Pill/Tag/StateDot/Menu/Modal/Toast/图标），版式与颜色走 --dsw-alias-* 与设置页排版约定；导入改弹层、删除改确认弹层、成功提示走 Toast、组动作收进 ⋯ 菜单。",
  "type": "module",
  "main": "lib/index.js",
  "exports": {
    ".": "./lib/index.js",
    "./client": "./client/client.js",
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "files": [
    "lib/index.js",
    "client/client.js",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "README.md",
    "AGENTS.md"
  ],
  "dependencies": {
    "@modelcontextprotocol/sdk": "^1.12.0"
  },
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    },
    "client": {
      "inject": [
        "slots"
      ],
      "platform": "web"
    }
  },
  "peerDependencies": {
    "@deepseek-ai/cordis": "^4.0.1",
    "react": "^18.2.0"
  },
  "license": "MIT",
  "keywords": [
    "dsh",
    "dsh-plugin",
    "deepseek-harness",
    "mcp",
    "mcp-servers",
    "cordis"
  ]
}
